{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42444","headline":"送锺员外 · 谢仲宣","name":"送锺员外","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"送人多折柳，唯我独吟松。\n若保岁寒在，何妨霜雪重。\n森梢逢静境，廓落见孤峰。\n还似君高节，亭亭尠继踪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"谢仲宣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}